00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.158
Well, guys, some news
out of Washington.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:26.826
It looks like
President Biden is likely

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.629
to keep the Space Force.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.498
Yeah. When asked why
they're keeping Space Force,

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:36.870
a Biden spokesperson said,
"Because it's funny."

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.943
That's right -- it looks like
Space Force is here to stay.

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:46.579
Apparently, Biden had
no choice after Trump signed

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:50.516
a 30-year lease with the moon.

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:52.652
Yep, Biden is keeping the
Space Force around

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.053
for a very important mission.

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:58.191
He's going to use them
to knock down the wall.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.026
Biden's decision
is actually a big deal.

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:02.361
When they heard, the
two members of the Space Force

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:07.433
high-fived in their
basement cubical.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.068
Yep, Biden is keeping
the Space Force,

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:10.903
but their budget
is somewhere between

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:12.938
the Department of
Hot Tub Regulations

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:14.173
and the Office of --

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:16.475
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:20.346
-Hey.
-You jumped on it, man.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:23.816
The Department of
Hot Tub Regulations

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.718
and the Office of VCR Repairs.

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:30.056
So in between, in betwixt.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.525
In betwixt the two.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.294
It seems like there's
so much going on right now.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:36.496
I mean, the stock market
is all over the place.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.597
Netflix just announced
that "Bridgerton"

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:42.701
is their most-watched
series ever.

00:01:42.701 --> 00:01:45.171
A Margaritaville Resort
is opening

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.240
in the middle of Times Square.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:51.643
And there's
a Grape-Nuts shortage.

00:01:51.643 --> 00:01:52.845
There's a lot to go over,

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:54.914
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:56.215
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:59.318
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:59.318 --> 00:02:01.487
[ Ding ]

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:02.955
First up, the stock market.

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:06.392
People on Reddit started buying
stock in GameStop as a joke,

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.494
