00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:24.210
The characters are high-society
Londoners, so fancy and proper.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.080
They're kind of like people
who wouldn't be caught dead at

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.216
