00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:40.593
If you ask me,
the whole thing seems nuts.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:42.495
Yeah, there's
a Grape-Nuts shortage.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.363
The company says
it's difficult to produce

00:02:44.363 --> 00:02:48.067
