most stores are out of stock.

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.970
What's happening?
Are stocks going up, down?

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.472
It feels like Reddit
took a hammer to the market,

00:02:53.472 --> 00:02:55.341
and now the
system's totally smashed.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.543
And if you want to get
totally smashed, why not try

00:02:57.543 --> 00:02:59.979
the Margaritaville Resort
in Times Square.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:02.315
You probably shouldn't swim
with a bunch of drunk strangers,

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.683
but do your thing.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:07.453
I'll be on my couch, sipping tea
and watching "Bridgerton."

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:08.554
It's a great show.

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:10.123
There's romance, scandal,

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:11.957
and, in that
classic British fashion,

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:13.459
the humor is really dry.

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:16.929
But not nearly as dry as
Grape-Nuts,

00:03:16.929 --> 00:03:21.500
