favorite gravel-based cereal.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:22.669
The company is suffering,

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:25.270
and that's why
we should all buy now.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.273
Get it while it's low.

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:31.177
There can be as rich as everyone
on "Bridgerton."

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:34.180
In conclusion,
it's taking a hit.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.015
It's full of Brits.

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.917
It's a spoonful of grit.

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:39.919
Elmo's about to get lit.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:42.255
This has been a "News Smash."

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:44.957
[ Cheers and applause ]
